{"id": "ja-final-07", "language": "ja", "text": "閉じないで、そのままにしてください。", "seconds": 0.7316230770084076, "first_audio_seconds": 0.7265865270164795, "first_sound_seconds": 1.0920031936831462, "duration": 3.025, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.7265865270164795, "duration": 3.025}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 23300, "frames": 72600}
{"id": "ja-final-08", "language": "ja", "text": "バイバイ。またね。", "seconds": 0.3823374949861318, "first_audio_seconds": 0.37923803899320774, "first_sound_seconds": 0.722946372326541, "duration": 1.825, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.37923803899320774, "duration": 1.825}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 22100, "frames": 43800}
{"id": "ja-final-09", "language": "ja", "text": "バイバイを英語に訳してください。会話は続けます。", "seconds": 0.829006636980921, "first_audio_seconds": 0.8244689040002413, "first_sound_seconds": 1.1814272373335746, "duration": 4.175, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.8244689040002413, "duration": 4.175}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 23124, "frames": 100200}
{"id": "ja-final-10", "language": "ja", "text": "一足す一の答えを教えてください。", "seconds": 0.5208660320204217, "first_audio_seconds": 0.5168628620158415, "first_sound_seconds": 0.8721128620158416, "duration": 3.175, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.5168628620158415, "duration": 3.175}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 25211, "frames": 76200}
